jump chapter 5/
label ACADEMY
update alien (sonho/feliz e olho aberto)
\doctor: I remember the day I graduated from the Imperial Science Academy.
\doctor: I was beginning my first steps in my scientific career. I was top of the class, and made a speech. I was full of pride and expectations
alien: I see… you take pride in your work
\doctor: It’s more than that. I was one of the few trans officers to survive until graduation.
\doctor: Their careers, I mean. There was a lot more scrutiny over our work. I did as much as I could so that no one would question my merits.
alien: It’s strange that such a thing would matter so much to those in power…
\doctor: et it does. They are trying to push us away because they need us to look weak.
\doctor: Wanna know the best part?
\doctor: My stupid father attended the ceremony. I hadn't seen him since I was 16.
\doctor: He told me and my mother that if she continued to support my ‘delusions’, then he would leave. And he did.
\doctor: But when I got my diploma, he came out of whatever hole he was hiding and tried to apologize.
\doctor: I told him to piss off.
\doctor: But it shows you the kind of respect that my position inspires, and why they are trying so hard to keep us away from it.
alien: I’m glad you found something to give you strength.And I hope those that come after you will be inspired by your example.
\doctor: ...Thank you.
\doctor: It’s just… it's only gotten harder.
\doctor: My career didn’t go as far as I know it could.
\doctor: But I haven’t given up yet. This is my chance to show them what I’m capable of.
alien (sonho/triste e boca fecada): Do you mean… you want to show the good work that you`re doing here…?
\doctor: I- [pause]I didn’t mean to…
\doctor: I still-
alien: No, I understand… We all have our burdens.\
Come, let’s enjoy the view…
leave --All--
(Despite the warm air, I feel a cold wall separating us as we float in silence. I wish I could say something to reach L3XA, but I can’t find the right words…)
